    "sentence_translations": [
      "Next Time, I’ll Take You to See a Movie",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Anne, I can’t find the movie theater. Do you know where the movie theater is?",
      "",
      "Anne: The movie theater is next to the hospital. Can you see the hospital?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: I can see the hospital now. I can also see the movie theater. Thank you! Where are you?",
      "",
      "Anne: I am at the airport with my dad and mom. We are going to Xi’an.",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Xi’an? Is it fun there?",
      "",
      "Anne: Xiaobei said it’s fun. It’s very beautiful, and many people like to travel there.",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: I hope you like it there.",
      "",
      "Anne: Thank you! Are you going to the movie theater to watch a movie? Who are you going with?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: No one is with me. I came by myself to watch a movie.",
      "",
      "Anne: Xiaobei likes watching movies. Next time, you can take him to watch a movie with you.",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Two guys watching a movie together, I don’t really like it.",
      "",
      "Anne: You want to watch a movie with a girl?",
      "",
      "Gao Tian: Yes! Next time I’ll take you to a movie. How does that sound?",
      "",
      "Anne: Sure, I like watching movies."
    ]
